{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-03_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-03","title":"通訊靜默解除","storyCode":"14-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"c9ddf95407f0639c5caeeb038926b6d0a5f802ace2c7f6bb04bac0b538ee4d36","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"可露希爾嘗試在戰場之中豎起恢復通信訊號的訊號塔，關鍵時刻，羅德島支援趕到，戰場通信恢復。典範軍則與高多汀公爵的軍隊合作，守住了受到襲擊的吉布森鎮。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":true,"text":"隊長，衍射儀的感測器可能出問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒壞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"我就說吧維克多，我的檢查結果也是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"顯示不了有效數據，也不一定是儀器出了錯，有可能是數據本身超出了區間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯，源石反應指標，大於……預設上限。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"各位，敵人已經圍上來了，我們還有三分鐘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"維克多年齡最小，我們要是用上所有辦法，應該還能給他安排一個逃生機會……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":true,"text":"小易，你以為我申請參加倫蒂尼姆行動，是為了誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"你這傢伙，真是從來都不聽勸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"可露希爾，你那邊的情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還活著，沒關係的，我的無人機上可是裝了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"我好像聽到了無人機墜毀的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"在以前，那些無人機可都是你的寶貝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"隊長啊，你讓自救軍撤退的時候，就知道了吧？那是最後的窗口期了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石活動數據還沒有擬合完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要……各位的數據"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"可露希爾，阿米婭不在，你就是我的隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"在來倫蒂尼姆之前，我們每一個人都和阿米婭聊過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"阻止戰爭，同時拯救維多利亞人和薩卡茲？說真的，就靠我們，這該有多難啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"可我還是選擇相信你們，相信……羅德島的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"哪個羅德島幹員不想看見礦石病被治好，大家的日子過得越來越好的那一天？這在大多數人眼裡不也是笑話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"非要說……死在這裡，我真覺得有點虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":true,"text":"小易，收到我的數據了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"收到了。隊長，新一批的數據傳給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"哦對，我也沒那麼無私……發論文的時候帶一下我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“通訊異常，通訊異常，正在失去訊號。”\n“能量波動數據傳入，自動分析模組啟動。”\n“天災規模已確定，開始計算未來二十四小時內源石環境模擬演變趨勢……”\n……\n“滋滋滋……隊長，防護罩……損壞……”\n“他們……正在……”\n“小易……撐住……我正在向你移動……滋滋滋……”\n“滋滋滋——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“可露希爾，加油。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工程師死死地盯著眼前的操作螢幕。\n快一些，再快一些。如果不能將這片戰場的源石活動數據擬合完畢，小隊所有的努力都會白費。\n在她四周，戰爭的咆哮正越來越近。\n無人機所剩無幾，她已經能感覺到敵人冰冷的呼吸。\n“……模型擬合成功。”\n“正在輸出安全區位置——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於，成功了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，只要豎起通訊塔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……血魔。叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭不會停止，你會成為養料。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剛剛升空的無人機被“靈幛”的劍鋒劈過，哀鳴著墜毀在地。\n那是她的最後一架戰鬥無人機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，別擋路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑的法術，羸弱的法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會有如你一般弱小的血魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劇痛襲來，可露希爾感覺自己的半邊身體一瞬間就麻木了。\n腐敗的氣息正鑽進她的身體。\n可露希爾幾乎已經握不住手上的通訊訊號塔，她只能勉強把這複雜的設備插在地上，支撐著自己的身體。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“通訊強度不足，設備受干擾程度——高。無法廣播安全區位置。”\n“請按設置說明——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，你不是血魔嗎，修復傷口啊！多扛一會，至少再久一點點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要把這玩意豎起來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不要辜負……不能辜負……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不想對不起所有人……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（還有自己。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希爾感覺到，“靈幛”冰冷的手，已經撫上自己的脖子。\n她已經被戰爭淹沒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"訊號……通訊訊號在亮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的訊號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，抓住我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……杜賓？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有力氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芬……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一柄小巧的匕首洞穿了“靈幛”的胸膛，巨大的能量隨即爆發而出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，來晚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧Misery先生通知了我們位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，更多人在路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，還差一點，掩護我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擋住他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i30"},{"type":"narration","text":"我們的使命究竟是什麼？在剛加入還叫巴別塔的羅德島時，可露希爾曾向不止一個人問出過這個問題。\n在那時，每個人的答案都各不相同。\n有人的理想很遠大，有人的願望卻很渺小。\n有人說得很具體，有人卻只是支支吾吾，最後撓撓頭，露出一個微笑。\n但在某種時刻，所有的人都會露出一樣的表情。\n在某種時刻，所有的人都會做出一樣的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"差的這最後一點點……補上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"“核心模組上線，通訊恢復。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，我們來了！撐住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們向典範軍同步了你們的位置，支援馬上就到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，可露希爾，可露希爾，你還好嗎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意和敵人拉開距離，給炮兵隊和弩手提供支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者的出現和天災關聯緊密，不要怕他們的巫術，看起來再古怪，也是一種源石技藝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住我們這一路是怎樣在天災中行軍的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能扛住天災，也能抵禦住這幫薩卡茲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……風笛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯？我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高多汀公爵說得沒錯，“風暴突擊隊”……本來就是議會直屬的部隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽從議會的命令，是我們的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這比公爵的邀請……更具有正當性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更不必說，答應他的話，你、羅本，還有許多不得已跟著我們行動的殘兵，所有人的身分問題都能得到解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身分問題？隊長，你忘了嗎，我本來就退役了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且……你剛剛站在推進之王身前架起盾的時候，可是一點猶豫都沒有欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說啊，推進之王帶著諸王之息……隊長，你見過諸王之息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王說得對，那只是一根有些意義的“鐵條”而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，有隊伍正在迅速從側翼接近……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們沒有識別碼，但我認得出來，是高多汀公爵的步兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們開始正式與薩卡茲交戰……並且，剛剛掩護了我們的一支小隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是高多汀“交朋友”的方法，那我們也會給予同等的回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍全員，與高多汀的軍隊合力作戰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到最後一個敵人被打退為止！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g13_warshipcommandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下，高速軍艦已經起航，我們已經暫時脫離危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲使用的巫術確實千奇百怪。與其讓他們不斷地騷擾我們的後方，還不如……露出點破綻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從作戰情況來看，“食腐者”的頭領，還有其他已知的擁有強大作戰能力的薩卡茲並沒有現身此處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，在他們眼裡，高多汀的威脅性，大概遠不及溫德米爾和威靈頓吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是……值得慶倖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，諸王之息仍未離開吉布森鎮。是否啟動後續計劃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比預想中的要多花一些功夫，亞歷山德莉娜的隊伍在逐漸壯大，作戰能力也比先前估計的要強一些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我問的並不是作為對手的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“典範軍”……你也說了，他們打得有模有樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們和我們留下的那些部隊的合作，也還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔和他們待在一塊，看起來還真比她爸爸更像傳說中的白狼。溫德米爾家的小女孩也沒情報裡那麼嬌弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人們想當英雄典範，說不定啊，真不是玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是，放棄由我們來護送國劍的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，怎麼能說成放棄呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然高多汀重視的是將來，那以後的路上，“亞歷山德莉娜”“諸王之息”“典範軍”，甚至“羅德島”……都未必不會與我們同行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g9_campedchariot"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們的戰車正在鎮子東面和最後一批薩卡茲交戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉布森鎮算是守住了。這裡可以被當作通往銀石崖前線的補給點，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地形變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿喃那”在不斷地改變倫蒂尼姆周邊的環境。本不該存在的地裂、山崖、湍流，到處都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銀石崖一帶幾乎每時每刻都在發生劇烈的天災。我們接下來的每一步會踩在哪裡，都難以預料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，要不是我知道羅德島的情報不可能出錯，我都不敢相信這是我們的倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"田野的微風彌漫溫暖♪♫朝陽照耀我們的家♬♪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕到時候，就連國歌的歌詞都得變一變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你還有心情開玩笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“打回去再考慮”，你一定想說這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算我們真的回去了……我們的家還能回到以前的樣子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們不僅要贏得這場戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還不能看著薩卡茲……用戰爭徹底毀掉倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的風暴，我們會闖過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風暴碾過的家園，我們也不能放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛費斯特已經跟我說過了，他的小隊在附近收到了更多求救訊號，希望能救出更多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉布森鎮上，與食腐者交戰過的區域也需要特殊處理，羅德島幹員會一如既往地提供幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要我們的人一起完成這些後方的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搭建補給線，搜救和轉移傷患，集結更多願意加入我們的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g9_campedchariot"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，跟著我們去前線的隊伍已集結完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上那些被抹去識別碼的高多汀士兵，典範軍的規模已經遠遠超過一個團。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們打算加入我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我去見了那支隊伍裡的軍官們，他們聲稱在他們登上運輸艦之前，高多汀公爵就已經離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我們的初步接觸結果來看，他留下的這支隊伍，全都由感染者組成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似曾相識，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和他的同僚一樣，高多汀公爵也拋下了感染者士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……又或者……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，他故意篩選了一批不幸感染的戰士，把他們送到我們的隊伍裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜他的確不懷好意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從高多汀的軍隊在吉布森鎮的表現來看，這批感染者士兵和我們過去遇見的那些不一樣，很難被稱為“殘兵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如高多汀的目的是跟蹤、監視我們，那我們最好想辦法把這群人甩開。實在甩不開，就在戰術上隔離……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，你比我更懂大公爵的手段。我明白，你的猜測極有可能是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但眼下我們正是需要團結的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果連典範軍都會篩選哪一部分維多利亞是該被“團結”的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們希冀的未來，又怎麼可能成立呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高多汀很可能就是料到了典範軍無法拒絕接納那些戰士，才輕易放我們離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就做好應對的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這一路，還會遇到很多挑戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，“阿喃那”……還有開斯特，以及其他大公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍要闖過的“風暴”，不可能只有一種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我會通知希勒少尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，有新人加入，大家都是高興大於擔憂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他們都是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們真的沒有被高多汀拋棄……這難道不也值得我們高興嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能發生的“聯合”，在未來，說不定會變成現實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……能遇到像你們一樣的人，真是奇蹟啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，“奇蹟”不是我們帶來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們直到最後一刻都沒有放棄，這才創造了屬於你們自己的“奇蹟”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"不管您怎麼說，都請讓我好好感謝您吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身體還撐得住，我會幫您一起安置更需要幫助的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"您也能稍微休息一下……仔細看看，您也就和我的孩子差不多大啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在去下一個地點實施救援之前，我們可以休整十分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可露希爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多給我一點時間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你握著的通訊施術單元夠完美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算Raidian和Mechanist見了，也很難再提出什麼改進意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……接下來的源石環境還會更惡劣。我做得更好一點，你們就能更安全一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉布森鎮附近的搜救工作已接近尾聲。接下來我們會去搜索……你的工程小隊最後失蹤的地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論這幾位幹員是否犧牲，我們都會去一一確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埋在沙暴中、被源石吞噬……都不會毫無痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們找到他們，帶著他們，或者他們的遺物回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芬，雖然我清楚自己的想法……但我也想聽聽更多人的真心話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個與眼前戰爭雙方都無關的羅德島幹員，為了薩卡茲和維多利亞人之間的戰爭而犧牲……是不是真的很遺憾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何任務，只要有犧牲，都很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace大哥犧牲之後，米格魯抱著他的盾哭了好幾夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼偏偏是他，會在那個時間那個地點離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也每一次都有這種感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我想知道的……是犧牲者的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……自己的遺憾，肯定也會有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都不是不怕死的聖人。可露希爾，你也不是。所以你會為之前的決定感到痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，作為參加本次支援行動的人，我不後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕不說為了炎熔和芙蓉，或者其他薩卡茲朋友，只是為了這些未曾謀面的人，我也願意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我從哥倫比亞來到羅德島的，就是一場天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那個時候我就知道，災難落到每個人頭上的時候，並不會區分我們誰是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我來到這裡，是因為我知道，當我的故鄉和我在意的人陷入危難的時候，你們也會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們一定會來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
